As others have pointed out, I should have mentioned where I live --
the  27513 zip code.  The XP 1000 weights about 45lbs and the UP1000
weighs about 34lbs according to a bathroom scale.

The UP1000 works fine the last I checked, it was main main workstation
until 2004 or so.  It has a graphics card.

The XP1000 is a little flaky.  It will power on when it is laid on its
side.  When standing vertically like it was meant to do, it will not
make it through the SRM self test due to PCI bus errors.   See
http://osdir.com/ml/freebsd.devel.alpha/2002-07/msg00209.html.



Drew


